<title>USA: IPO PRICING- Novel priced $18, above range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING- Novel priced $18, above range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	 Novel Denim Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $18</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $15 - $17</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			4,250,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	  Morgan Stanley &amp; Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The proposed number of shares for the planned initial public offering in Novel Denim Holdings Ltd were raised to 4.25 million shares from 3.75 million shares previously.</p>
</text>
